<title>USA: Richmond County, Ga., repriced, yields lowered.</title>
<headline>Richmond County, Ga., repriced, yields lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Robinson-Humphrey Co Inc said Tuesday it repriced and restructured County Board of Education of Richmond County, Ga.'s $115 million bond deal, lowering yields in several maturities but leaving the top yield in 2026 unchanged at 5.95 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>COUNTY BOARD OF EDUCATION OF RICHMOND COUNTY</p>
<p>GEORGIA GENERAL OBLIGATION SCHOOL BONDS, SERIES 97</p>
<p>RE: $115,000,000*</p>
<p>REGISTERED</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>		 A1 UNDERLYING	    A UNDERLYING</p>
<p>MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 01/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 05/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 11/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>11/01/1998		  395M    3.65  %	100.00</p>
<p>11/01/1999		  520M    4.05  %	100.00</p>
<p>11/01/2000		  655M    4.35  %	100.00</p>
<p>11/01/2001		  800M    4.55  %	100.00</p>
<p>11/01/2002		  950M    4.70  %	100.00</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>11/01/2003		1,115M    4.85  %	100.00</p>
<p>11/01/2004		1,290M    4.95  %	100.00</p>
<p>11/01/2005		1,475M    5.05  %	100.00</p>
<p>11/01/2006		1,670M    5.20  %	100.00</p>
<p>11/01/2007		1,885M    5.30  %	100.00</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>11/01/2008		2,110M    5.40  %	100.00</p>
<p>11/01/2009		2,355M    5.50  %	100.00</p>
<p>11/01/2010		2,620M    5.55  %	100.00</p>
<p>11/01/2012		6,100M    5.65  %	100.00</p>
<p>11/01/2017	     21,325M    5.90  %	100.00</p>
<p>11/01/2026	     69,735M    5.95  %	100.00</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES:</p>
<p>The bonds are redeemable at the option of the District, in whole or in part by lot in inverse order of maturity on any interest payment date beginning 5/1/98 at par plus accrued interest.</p>
<p>The District presently plans to call a referendum on 3/18/97 on the imposition of a 1% special purpose local option sales tax to provide funds for the purpose of, among other things, redeeming the Bonds.</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, January 9, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on January 23, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is not book entry.</p>
<p>This issue is pending through DTC.</p>
<p>The Robinson-Humphrey Company, Inc.</p>
<p>SunTrust Capital Markets, Inc.</p>
<p>Jackson Securities Incorporated</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
